[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i510"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一晚过去，我的记忆还是没有恢复的迹象。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在岛上四处转了转也没找到什么线索。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但神奇的是，我走到哪都不会迷路。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"难道说，我不是第一次来这座岛吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过既然没有人认识我，我应该不是岛上的居民。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i90"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我身上除了一开始穿着的这身衣服也别无它物了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"口袋里也是空空的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……嗯？不对，好像有什么东西。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是一片羽翼。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这是鸟的羽毛吗？还是什么虫子的？"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i90"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“老爷子，这个。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12403"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“这是什么的羽毛啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12413"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“唔……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“……会不会是凯瑟琳的？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12408"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“凯瑟琳؟؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“没什么。这个是鸡的羽毛吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12403"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“不是。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12408"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“这根本也不是鸟类的羽毛。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12403"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“你是说这个装在你的口袋里？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“是的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12413"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“你这家伙到底是从哪里来的啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“你那个叫法。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12408"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“‘你’。太粗鲁了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12403"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“呃。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12413"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“咳咳。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12403"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“想必您是从非常遥远的地方来到此地的吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“感觉怪恶心的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12410"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“那你想怎样啊!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“你叫我小姑娘也好啊，为什么偏偏选叫‘您’啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12413"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“我只是用了更有礼貌的方式而已。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总之，我明白了一件事情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"老爷子……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"小鸠老爷子，是个很不擅言辞的人。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i90"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"老爷子每天早上还算深夜的时候就出门，然后中午回来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"简单处理一下家务之后就会去睡觉。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽则是早上一个人跑出去玩，午饭的时候回来吃饭……然后再出去玩到傍晚。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也不知道她都是去哪里玩。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而我……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好像没什么事可做。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且不知为何，我对这种感觉有印象。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明是夏天，全只是无所事事地打发着时间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"失忆前的我，是怎么过夏天的呢？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是和谁一起玩？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还是自己一个人玩呢？"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i91"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“我开动了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12292"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我开动了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"摆在餐桌上的晚饭，乍一看挺丰盛的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"新鲜的鱼刺身、章鱼刺身、刚采的裙带菜、鲜活的虾。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"全都是老爷子钓到的东西。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"问题是……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"每天都是这些。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然又新鲜又好吃……"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12291"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽面无表情地吃着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对小孩子来说，每天都吃刺身有点受不了吧。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i517"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"晚上，我又来到了外面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"本以为来到我醒过来的地方，可能会离我失去的记忆更近一些。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然而并没有用。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1492"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我只是什么事都不做……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"什么事也做不到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就这样静静等着夏天过去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样真的可以吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我觉得不行。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"什么都不做，就什么都不会有改变。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总而言之――"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i91"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12292"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"‘我开动了。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"‘……’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽面无表情吃饭的模样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真的不太好。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1492"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我来给白羽做饭吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…………"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……咦？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我会做饭吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为什么呢？我就是想要给她做饭。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"难道这是我所遗忘的记忆吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"搞不懂。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，正是因为搞不懂。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"才更应该去尝试一下。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i507"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第二天。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“唔。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我看了一下冰箱里的东西。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有没有能用这些材料做的菜呢？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看着冰箱里的东西……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我脑海中浮现出一个想法。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“好。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……二十分钟后。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i278"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我把切碎的蔬菜和海鲜跟剩饭炒在了一起。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为什么是炒饭呢？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我只是一边想着一边做，没想到做得还挺顺手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就好像我经常做炒饭一样。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12339"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽似乎是被香味吸引，走了过来。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12331"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“你在做什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“炒饭。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12339"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽大吃一惊。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12365"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“妈妈？你是在做妈妈吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12366"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那真的好厉害啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“不是不是。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“是炒饭。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12331"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽看着平底锅里的东西陷入了沉思。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“是烤米饭吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“不是的，这是炒饭。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12339"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“可这就是烤米饭啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“炒饭。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12356"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“炒饭。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽疑惑地重复了一遍。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"作为调味，我把酱油顺着平底锅边缘倒进去，不让它直接接触到米饭。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"再撒上一些胡椒，稍微翻炒一下关火。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i90"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“完成！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“来，吃吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12363"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我、我不要。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“别啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“我可是特意给你做的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12356"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“多、多管闲事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“怎么这样……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咕―。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12354"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽的肚子叫了起来。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12311"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她一下子小脸通红。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“吃吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12301"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽红着脸轻轻点了点头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……然后小心翼翼地尝了一口。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12292"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“好吃。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“太好了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“每天都吃刺身肯定吃腻了吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12295"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“那你怎么不说出来呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12331"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“可那都是外公辛苦给我准备的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“你那样岂不是太见外了吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“见外？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“这种事，你不好好说清楚他是不会明白的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“刺身我已经吃腻啦！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“这样说出来。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12403"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“那还真是对不起啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“呜哇啊啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“刺身出现了！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12408"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“你说谁是刺身！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12403"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“你们在吃什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12291"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“烤米饭。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“炒饭。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我和白羽沉默地对视着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来双方都不打算退让。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"老爷子看着我们，叹了口气。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“……这个，是七海你做的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“是，我借用了冰箱里的东西。没关系吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“无所谓……我也尝一口。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“请用请用。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"老爷子坐到桌前，吃起了炒饭。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12413"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“……唔。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12403"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“很好吃啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“不过，这个味道……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“有什么问题吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12413"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“没什么。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"欲言又止的老爷子继续吃起炒饭。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"难道说……我做的炒饭不好吃吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"老爷子默默地吃了一会儿。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12403"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“这样啊，刺身已经吃腻了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后突然说道。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12300"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“对不起。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12408"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“没、没事。没关系。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12413"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“毕竟，我也只会把鱼钓上来然后处理一下。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“可之前您不是做过凯瑟琳吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12408"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“凯瑟琳？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“就是那个炸鸡块。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12403"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“哦，那是我把鸡给了邻居。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“然后作为回礼把做好的分给我了一些而已。我自己不会做饭。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12413"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“唔……这样啊。七海你会做饭啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“似乎是这样。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过感觉炒饭以外的我也不会做。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12403"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“如果你愿意的话，能不能偶尔给白羽……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12408"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“不。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12403"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“不能让你做这些事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"老爷子似乎在掩饰什么。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“是吗？反正也很闲，我不介意的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“不，不用了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12413"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“再怎么说你都是客人。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“唉。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i90"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"老爷子很快吃完炒饭，然后就回自己的房间了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽则是一口一口慢慢品尝。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"似乎还在一边思考着什么事。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“这个。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“是爸爸的味道。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12292"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽盯着炒饭，不知道在想些什么。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那个。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“请你教我怎么做！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“做这个？”"},{"op":"set","variable":26027,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽使劲点了点头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“可以是可以。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“但我也只是凭感觉做的，不知道能不能教会你啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“而且，你外公好像不太希望我做饭的样子。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“是吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在这个家里做炒饭的话肯定会被闻出来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然表面上我是客人，但实际上在给这个家添麻烦。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以我也不太想违背老爷子的意思。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这应该算是最基本的礼仪。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然而，我还是很想答应白羽的请求。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12331"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那就，那个。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我也把我秘密的地方告诉你。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“秘密的地方？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12334"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯，在那里就可以做炒饭，不用担心了。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽把我带到了坡道下面一间很小的店里。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i15"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“这里是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有客座，墙上贴着菜单。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大量的盘子，还有硕大的煤气灶。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然没人，但这里应该是个食堂。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“现在这里没有在营业吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"店里还是挺干净的，感觉是可以营业的状态。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是店内却并没有人的气息。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仿佛在我们进来之前，这里的时间停止了一样。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12292"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“爸爸都是在这里做饭的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"环视着店内的白羽说着。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i420"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12294"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“妈妈不怎么会做饭。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12294"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“但是喜欢吃。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12313"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“所以平时都是爸爸做饭，妈妈给他帮忙。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12291"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“但是，在这个夏天之前……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12310"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“爸爸就出事故死了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12300"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“之后，妈妈也不知道去哪里了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽父母的事，老爷子已经跟我说过了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但当我再次从白羽这么小的孩子口中听到时。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"心中还是非常难受。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i15"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然，白羽抬头看向房顶。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也随着她的视线抬起头。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i507"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"透过天窗，可以看到外面的天空。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"湛蓝、洁白、耀眼的天空。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是已经看过无数次的，夏日的天空。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12355"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“妈妈现在，在一个很远很远的地方。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"七海","text":"“很远的地方？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12330"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12336"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“说不定，妈妈正在找爸爸。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12346"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“因为他们非常要好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽如此说着，眼角在不断颤抖。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i189"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12414"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“一个月前。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"――","text":"“嗯？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“那孩子的父亲，在一场事故中去世了，当时他离开岛出去采购。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“那孩子再见到的，已经是守夜时……棺木里冰冷的父亲了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“那之后不久，白羽的母亲……也就是我的女儿失踪了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12409"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“她的父母，都离她而去。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“在短短一个月之内。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“所以她现在还有些不好接触。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“但经历了这么多事，她已经非常努力了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12414"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“她是个坚强的孩子。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“即使在我面前，也几乎没有哭过。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i15"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“也或许，是因为过度悲伤。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"“已经连哭都哭不出来了吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一旦眼泪流下来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就相当于承认了那些悲伤的事情都是真的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这只是她小小的抵抗而已。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"如果真的是这样，那也……太痛苦了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽走进店的后堂，拿出扫帚和簸箕。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后默默开始打扫。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这就是这间店一个月没人来也依然很干净的原因吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也开始和她一起打扫。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"同时，祈盼着这里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可以永远保持现在的样子。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]